## Quick Decision Tree

| Scenario | Action |
|----------|--------|
| Modifying backend entity | Check `.cursor/rules/02-backend.mdc` + domain patterns |
| Adding React component | Check `.cursor/rules/03-frontend.mdc` + module patterns |
| Database schema change | Check `.cursor/rules/04-database.mdc` + Alembic patterns |
| Business rule change | Check `.cursor/rules/05-business-rules.mdc` + existing workflows |
| Security question | Check `.cursor/rules/06-security.mdc` + RBAC matrix |
| Implementation stuck | Run through 12-step workflow |
| Task complete? | Verify all 13 Definition of Done items |

